{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44616","headline":"诗 二 · 拾得","name":"诗 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嗟见世间人，个个爱吃肉。\n椀楪不曾乾，长时道不足。\n昨日设个斋，今朝宰六畜。\n都缘业使牵，非干情所欲。\n一度造天堂，百度造地狱。\n阎罗使来追，合家尽啼哭。\n鑪子边向火，镬子里澡浴。\n更得出头时，换却汝衣服。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"拾得","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44616.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44616","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}